  <h1>American Express Historical Stock Performance</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">A comprehensive analysis of AXP's long-term risk-return profile spanning over five decades of daily trading data, from June 1972 through March 2026.</div>
  <div class="meta">
    <div><span>Coverage Period</span>{a['period']['start']} → {a['period']['end']}</div>
