      <tr><td><span class="badge green">BULL</span></td><td>Oct 1974 → Jun 1983</td><td class="num pos">+641%</td><td>Volcker disinflation, financial deregulation</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge red">BEAR</span></td><td>Oct 1989 → Oct 1990</td><td class="num neg">-53.9%</td><td>S&amp;L crisis, Gulf War recession, AXP credit issues</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge green">BULL</span></td><td>Oct 1990 → Oct 2000</td><td class="num pos">+1,449%</td><td>Long expansion, financial-sector re-rating</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge red">BEAR</span></td><td>Oct 2000 → Sep 2001</td><td class="num neg">-59.1%</td><td>Dot-com unwind &amp; 9/11</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge green">BULL</span></td><td>Sep 2001 → Jul 2007</td><td class="num pos">+209%</td><td>Credit-cycle expansion, consumer spending boom</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge red">BEAR</span></td><td>Jul 2007 → Mar 2009</td><td class="num neg">-83.9%</td><td>Global Financial Crisis — worst drawdown in dataset</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge green">BULL</span></td><td>Mar 2009 → Jul 2014</td><td class="num pos">+924%</td><td>Post-GFC recovery, ZIRP-era expansion</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge red">BEAR</span></td><td>Feb 2020 → Mar 2020</td><td class="num neg">-49.6%</td><td>COVID-19 pandemic shock (32-day collapse)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><span class="badge green">BULL</span></td><td>Mar 2020 → Dec 2025</td><td class="num pos">+502%</td><td>Pandemic recovery, premium-card monetization</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</section>

<section id="volatility">
  <h2>2. Volatility &amp; Risk Assessment</h2>
  <p>Daily-return volatility annualized to <strong>{a['kpis']['annualized_volatility']:.2f}%</strong> over the full dataset — a level consistent with single-name financial-sector equity. The drawdown profile, charted below, shows that AXP has spent extended periods materially below its trailing peak.</p>

  <div class="chart-box tall">
    <div class="chart-title">Monthly Drawdown from Trailing Peak (%) — Underwater Plot</div>
