  <p>American Express has been a consistent dividend payer across the dataset, with cumulative per-share distributions of <strong>$''' + f"{a['kpis']['total_dividends']:.2f}" + '''</strong> across <strong>''' + str(a['dividend_events_count']) + '''</strong> events. The chart below shows the steady growth in annual per-share payouts.</p>

  <div class="chart-box">
